  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the ruins of old Subchain City, Wrencher scavenged for parts and learned to fix anything to survive. He's seen more code crashes than sunrises, and the sight of another defunct node barely registers a flicker of emotion in his dead eyes.",
